{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Cell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure inside an algal cell. Journey through its expansive microscopic world, uncover hundreds of proteins, jump, fight, solve puzzles, and perhaps discover why you find yourself within this cell in the first place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045010/extras/074ec4b8870866056b06aab6861b66d8.avif?t=1770180887\" width=1508 height=304 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a hand crafted microscopic world built using experimental data from cryogenic electron microscopy/tomography, X-ray crystallography, and sequence based structure prediction.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles designed based on mechanisms of biological processes to unlock hidden content.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a narrative-driven storyline that unfolds throughout your adventure. Reveal the secrets hidden inside the cell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy breathtaking visuals powered by Unreal Engine 5, showcasing the intricate and crowded cellular environment at atomic resolution.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045010/extras/91ca6436cda08805157ff4f754ba6468.avif?t=1770180887\" width=1554 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045010/extras/4f4c75640901dfb67b8702473e135d37.avif?t=1770180887\" width=1554 height=324 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Stage of Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free Demo is available that allows players to explort the 